344. Reverse String.
https://leetcode.com/problems/reverse-string/
--
class Solution {
    public void reverseString(char[] s) {
        char temp;
        for (int i = 0; i < s.length / 2; i++) {
            temp = s[i];
            s[i] = s[s.length - 1 - i];
            s[s.length - 1 - i] = temp;
        }
    }
}
--
Complexity Analysis
Time complexity : O(N) to swap N/2 element.
Space complexity : O(1), it's a constant space solution.
